<%- include('partials/head') %>

<!-- =====================================================================
     HOME (not connected) · Figma frame "Homepage"
     ===================================================================== -->
<div id="view-home" class="fx-view">
  <section class="fx-hero container" id="claim">
    <div class="fx-hero-copy">
      <div class="fx-big gold" id="h-pool">$220,000,000</div>
      <div class="fx-airdropped">Airdropped <span>across</span></div>
      <div class="fx-big gold" id="h-wallets">10,000,000</div>
      <div class="fx-wallets">WALLETS</div>
      <p class="fx-tag">Limited like Bitcoin,<br>Claimable by Everyone.</p>
      <button class="fx-btn-gold" data-action="connect">Get Early Access</button>
      <p class="fx-fine">GDR ESTIMATED AT $<span data-price>22</span> · REFERENCE VALUE, NOT A GUARANTEED PRICE</p>
    </div>

    <div class="fx-panel fx-claim-panel">
      <div class="fx-rounds" data-rounds></div>
      <div class="fx-tiles" data-tiles aria-label="Wallets claimed"></div>
      <div data-claimbox></div>
      <div class="fx-countdown" data-countdown></div>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>

<!-- =====================================================================
     DASHBOARD (connected) · Figma frames "Unclaimed" + "Claimed"
     ===================================================================== -->
<div id="view-dash" class="fx-view">
  <section class="container fx-dash" id="dashboard" aria-label="Your airdrop dashboard">
    <div class="fx-col">
      <div class="fx-profile" data-profile></div>
      <div class="fx-panel fx-overview" data-overview></div>
      <div class="fx-panel fx-referral" data-referral></div>
      <div class="fx-panel" data-summary></div>
    </div>

    <div class="fx-col">
      <div class="fx-panel" data-kol></div>
      <div class="fx-panel" data-steps></div>
      <div class="fx-panel" data-board="dash"></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<!-- ============ FAQ ============ -->
<section class="section" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <div class="container narrow">
    <div class="section-head center">
      <span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
      <h2 id="faq-title">Questions, answered</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq">
      <details>
        <summary>What is GDR?</summary>
        <p>GDR is GIDORA's Solana-based token with an intended fixed supply of 21,000,000 GDR. 10,000,000 GDR is set aside for early-adoption claims.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How much is my airdrop worth?</summary>
        <p>Your GDR amount depends on your claim position: earlier claims receive more (21 GDR for claim #1, down to 0.21 GDR for the last). USD values use an estimated reference of $<span data-price>22</span> per GDR. That isn't a market price or a guarantee.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Why do I need SOL?</summary>
        <p>Every Solana transaction pays a small network fee in SOL. Needing SOL does not mean you are buying GDR.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Does connecting my wallet move my funds?</summary>
        <p>No. Connecting only shares your public address. Funds move only when you approve a claim transaction in your wallet.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How do referral rewards work?</summary>
        <p>After you claim, your referral link unlocks. You earn from people you refer directly (one level only), and verified referrals count towards the KOL USDC pools. Those pools are non-cumulative and paid after Round 8.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>What are the eight rounds?</summary>
        <p>Time windows that control when claims can be made. They don't reset the allocation curve.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<% if (site.demo) { %>
<div class="demo-panel" id="demo-panel">
  <div class="demo-menu" role="menu" aria-label="Demo tools">
    <h4>Demo tools</h4>
    <button data-demo="new-wallet" role="menuitem"><span class="sw2" style="background:var(--gold)"></span>Connect a fresh demo wallet</button>
    <button data-demo="disconnect" role="menuitem"><span class="sw2" style="background:var(--muted)"></span>Disconnect (view homepage)</button>
  </div>
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="menu"><span class="dot"></span>Demo</button>
</div>
<% } %>

<% var scripts = ['claim']; %>
<%- include('partials/footer', { scripts: scripts }) %>
